yed than submitted.                                                 | Bound guests to ten and remaining capacity, synchronize displayed input, and enforce the 2000-character answer limit before registration or waitlist writes.                                      | Resolved in assembly 30ab75: all 145 app files / 1,152 tests and ten rebuilt registration/add-on Browser tests pass. Repeated guest edits and the exact answer boundary retain the original successful signup, readback and cleanup.                                                                                                                                                         |\n+| F-220 | Medium   | An email request deadline can stop waiting while a stalled response-body reader continues after headers arrive.                                                                                                       | Keep one scoped abort signal through the full provider operation, preserving the delivery-unknown outcome and single-attempt policy.                                                              | Resolved in assembly: the stalled body-consumer regression and all 214 server files / 1,672 tests pass. The single-attempt delivery-unknown contract is preserved; no real provider request is sent by the regression.                                                                                                                                                                       |\n+| F-221 | Low      | Platform template question help text can exceed its schema limit and block saving without a field explanation.                                                                                                        | Display the existing description validation message beside the field and keep independent add-on creation available at the question cap.                                                          | Resolved in assembly: the loaded-template regression and all 145 app files / 1,152 tests pass. The